cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "ISO 20022 message-gaming benchmark: generator, evader, screening abstraction, detectors and temporal evaluation harness for 'Gaming ISO 20022 Payment Messages'"
abstract: >-
  A seeded synthetic benchmark of eleven message-level manipulations of
  ISO 20022 pain.001 and pacs.008 records (misfielding, purpose-code
  substitution, message-path changes) against a transparent screening
  abstraction with a controlled ordinary-error floor, with cross-fitted
  detectors, exact alert-capacity metrics, screening-evasion lift, and a
  verification pipeline that traces every number in the paper to the result
  files.
type: software
